const [primes, composites] = separateNumbers(arr);

console.log(primes);      // Output: [2, 3, 5, 7]
console.log(composites);  // Output: [10, 9, 8, 6, 4]
```

In this example, the input array `[2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]` contains prime numbers `[2, 3, 5, 7]` and composite numbers `[10, 9, 8, 6, 4]`.

