console.log(findPairsWithHighestDistance(strings));
```

Output:
```
[["hello", "racecar"], ["world", "javascript"]]
```

In this example, the pair with the highest Levenshtein distance is `["hello", "racecar"]` with a distance of 7. The pair `["world", "javascript"]` also has a distance of 7, so both pairs are returned.

