  { country: '+44', area: '', prefix: '123', line: '4567890' },
  { country: '+91', area: '', prefix: '987', line: '6543210' }
]
```

Note that this solution has a time complexity of O(nlogn) because the regular expression `exec` function has a time complexity of O(n) and the sorting operation has a time complexity of O(nlogn).

